{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 39, :comments ["<b>And they baked the dough.</b> In Sukkot, which was the first encampment." "<b>Rounds of matzot.</b> What is the reason? כי גרשו ממצרים, for they were driven out of Egypt, etc. And here our Rabbis said in the chapter מי שהיה טמא: the prohibition of leaven of the Egyptian Passover applies only one day, while the Passover of generations applies all seven days. And thus it is in the Haggadah: This matzah that we eat — on account of what? On account of לא הספיק, that it did not have time, etc."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:57:26.451351416Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}